  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 803.09 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before Medicaid may be billed.\n\nSource. #7865, eff 5-1-03; ss by #9914, INTERIM, eff 5-1-11, EXPIRES: 10-28-11; ss by #10010, eff 10-28-11, EXPIRED: 10-28-19 (from He-E 803.10)",
